        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Hamilton AP-111.15, 15\" Traditional Style Solid Cast Bronze Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nTraditional Style pull for your refrigerator, appliances or other doors, cast in solid bronze with high quality craftsmanship. The Hamilton AP-111.15 pull is packaged standard for Thrubolt Mounting and features a circular mounting base.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Hamilton Traditional Style Bronze Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Bronze Patina</b></li>\r\n<li>Length c.c.: 15\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Base Diameter: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bronze Patina finish over Solid Cast Bronze</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AP-111.pdf?v=1704262223\" target=\"new\"><b>Hamilton AP-111 Specifications (PDF)</a></b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>\r\n<br><br>\r\nThis item is Discontinued.\r\n<br><br>\r\n</b>\r\n</p>",
